{
  "bodyHash": "306f6a01da04d3d5",
  "content": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_4b27a9e4-8414-4d22-bb39-268eebd99129.png\" width=\"1082\" height=\"137\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <iframe width=\"793\" height=\"464\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QW3HqoWXRFg?t=21s\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_8f44d6cd-1169-4d2d-9511-b5ef389b18a4.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">Arda 的幽匿模組是一個讓你能夠透過改善遊戲中的幽匿方塊來製作更強大工具和物品的模組。</p>\n## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  1.4 及以上版本需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\"><strong>GECKOLIB</strong></a>。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">- 模組內容 -</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_55965104-f602-4470-a603-b3ecb63ccd4a.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_6de15eb4-13de-4a66-b669-df765ce41cae.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">新傳送門</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">遊戲中新增了一個傳送門，你可以使用從古代城市收集的新材料製作傳送門點燃器來開啟這個古老的傳送門。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  • <strong>古代世界：</strong>要進入這個維度，需要 <strong>古代世界傳送門點燃器</strong> 物品。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_4d9c1c2c-050b-479c-8b5c-baa0426a7232.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿花朵</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">添加了許多可用於裝飾和作為光源的花卉與植物。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_9e8b95fa-bb7f-4139-918b-726e60d17cd4.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">古代城市礦石</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_c5246a13-0b0d-46b1-a25f-08b2877a5b7b.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_34a701e5-29aa-47a2-a43e-fead4b9d5218.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">新戰利品</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">遊戲中添加了更多新物品，包括可以在古代城市的箱子中找到的幽匿升級模板。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e7154663-0921-4958-a706-e42c4dff2ccb.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_bc0c0567-3cdc-4ecb-ab65-228f525df182.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_23463e01-80c6-43fb-8951-85de0964145d.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿傀儡</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">在新的Boss區域，你可以戰鬥幽匿傀儡Boss，並利用它掉落的幽匿水晶製作新的幽匿多用途工具！</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_ff537b25-edec-407c-84ba-5e9a7ca026ce.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_fc741a09-dd2d-48cf-96fd-edab0890f7f5.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">暗影獵手</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_44fc05ba-dd0b-410a-a13d-87fcf89a4d33.png\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_f00db0a4-80df-4f05-94d5-db9dcfbc0da5.png\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_93d053d1-63d9-410a-97bb-71701e28ded5.png\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_959ff98e-4c38-4cc1-8e59-364dba172f2b.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">輻射監守者</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_b40fdda4-6413-4979-bc77-18f3cf9a7cd6.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76fd5e0f-bfda-4bf5-a466-3630603d5623.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿手臂</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">新添加的幽匿手臂將賦予你與監守者一樣強有力的拳頭，這些幽匿手臂是使用從古代城市的箱子和生物中獲得的材料製作的。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_b2a99088-58fa-4896-936a-eb1539792919.png\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1fc8c2bd-6f35-4e5f-b726-b38c1e41c56e.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿金物品！</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">下界合金之後的新強力幽匿金工具。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_9fd7e796-35b1-42bc-ac15-1b37312ec27a.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2c7d7561-842a-4854-9a5b-2a25e18da36e.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">靈魂幽匿平原</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">與普通幽匿草相比，地上的草會減慢生物的速度，而周圍的灵魂感知器會進一步減慢玩家的速度。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_ec846fa0-ce1b-47e0-a044-940c96926477.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿平原</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">它們是新維度中的平坦地區。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e6020889-c83c-4c99-bcde-eef4c0c761c1.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">黑樺木森林</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">這是一個危險的生物羣系，尖嘯生物生活在茂密的樹林中。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_605904f1-61a8-4013-95c9-413b4960fce9.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿沙漠</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">這些是乾燥的地區，沒有樹木來生產材料。我們周圍有古老的傳送門，允許我們返回正常世界。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e3c8c116-1afb-45fe-b727-99c12dad42c1.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">紫藤森林</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">這是一個被岩石環繞的生物羣系，這裡的樹木比其他生物羋系更美麗、更多彩。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_b7df097e-32a4-454f-96fe-4c1686b9676d.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿森林</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">幽匿林地是幽匿平原生物羋系的一個版本，擁有更多的樹木和更少的骨骼。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_414f0aa3-7617-4e67-952c-ad94e85f4990.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">輻射輕木森林</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_eda60703-423f-477f-b5dc-00d32d854590.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_fa8da897-79e7-499b-bfa8-5ef103658cc1.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿木製組件</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"1205\" height=\"75\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1ac01893-6955-4624-b41f-fb1e1354280a.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">黑樺木製組件</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e8e70767-1c3b-45f4-b2ee-6eceaf3b058a.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">紫藤木製組件</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_a584f0bc-5591-42ea-898b-6099ace7d22b.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">輻射輕木製組件</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_50598260-632b-4ae5-b744-689af583bb30.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_efe7618d-1b7b-45b4-90a9-f377145dd764.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿苦力怕</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 幽匿主題的苦力怕，當它爆炸時，會在周圍產生黑暗和緩慢效果。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_4bfd2f4a-7b44-4423-874b-79d316c9b74f.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿骷髏</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 幽匿主題的骷髏，它會擊退擊中的生物並給予它們黑暗效果。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_bc5c4e19-a4d5-4d56-a7d8-72de778c8d07.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿末影人</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 幽匿主題的末影人。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_dba77b96-6ee1-4f4b-a94b-fb73ec921c83.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿魚</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 沒什麼特別的。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_d501e0ce-da66-45fa-a1cf-61a2cba3fb59.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿狐狸</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 幽匿主題的狐狸。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_9e356707-e327-4467-9bbf-da7fbe61cbdb.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">敏捷史萊姆</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 這是一種非常快速且靈活的史萊姆類型；當它死亡時，它會像普通史萊姆一樣分裂成兩半。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2ee022be-d3a9-4510-9982-d8499e0945c7.png\">\n</p>## <p align=\"center\">幽匿幽灵</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 幽匿幽灵是一种飞行的敌对生物，试图杀死玩家。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_75909905-e438-492a-bf07-478b8dee2792.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">幽匿尖体</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 一种拥有强力手臂的尖啸敌对生物。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2614dde6-c021-4fad-98ba-13f9edc2c3a3.png\">\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_ae6d0147-524f-474b-bfff-e462a8e0cc15.png\"></p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">黑暗村民</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">\n  • 一位村庄商人，出售与古城和深暗域生物群系特定的物品。\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_c0a368e9-e92c-4bac-aebe-1a14d7c583e2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_f1a8bcc5-63a3-418d-ac35-5b609c62cdbd.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_cee91609-8965-4784-9005-b7baa64607de.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">高级熔炉</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">将熔岩桶和熔岩幽匿桶分别放入前两个槽位，然后将需要转化的物品放入第3个槽位，并在第3个槽位下方添加燃料。最后从最后两个槽位取出普通版本的两个桶以及转化后的物品。如上图所示。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_12e85be5-7ac2-44c6-ab2b-355ae19a3d8a.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_02b588a7-b8bc-4e4c-9239-0561f47fcfa4.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">高级熔炉</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">这就是高级熔炉的样子！</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_44046397-a602-4049-ac64-1d79431f2108.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_7d390d6c-8416-473f-a09f-8bde137412ba.png\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">新材质</p> ## \n<p align=\"center\">游戏中加入了高级熔炉，帮助你将下界合金物品提升到下一个等级，并在遇到困难时使事情变得更轻松。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_6bdf82b0-def1-49c4-ab2a-e7d17d1c1d43.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">- 版本 -</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">-1.21.1</p>\n<hr>\n<p align=\"center\">-1.20.1</p>\n<p align=\"center\">-此版本是从1.21.1降级至1.20.1的Arda的Sculks 1.4.3.3。</p>\n<p align=\"center\">-结构中不会有箱子战利品，并且可能存在许多错误。</p>\n<p align=\"center\">-这些错误将不会修复，重点将放在新版本上。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">- 已知问题 -</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">(如果我的模组在Minecraft服务器上崩溃，请确保已安装GeckoLib，因为如果没有安装，模组将会崩溃而不是给出警告！)<br><br>- 除了少数纹理错误外，我没有发现任何影响游戏玩法的bug。<br><br>- 如果你使用的是1.20.1版本，可能会遇到许多错误，因为1.20.1版本是通过降级1.21.1版本添加的，我尽力修复了尽可能多的错误。</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n## <p align=\"center\">- 翻译 -</p> ## \n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_fe5a94ce-ebdd-42b1-a135-92ba73b9d529.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"> <strong>Arda Ayd. (Ixra)</strong> :  <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ixraplayer.github.io/\">https://ixraplayer.github.io/</a>\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_a2dea3a6-e9b8-4156-893d-ab1be0a5e019.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><strong>  Iago Emanuel</strong> :  <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://iagoemanuel.weebly.com/\">https://iagoemanuel.weebly.com/</a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">你可以在模组包中使用我的模组。</p>\n\n[有关模组的更多详细信息](https://github.com/IxraPlayer/Ardas-Sculks)",
